# Tool-scoped line-ending control.
#
# The repo runs with core.autocrlf=true (Git's Windows default). Without this
# file, the golden-test fixtures under tests/golden/ would be checked out with
# CRLF on Windows, while the markdown->HTML converter always emits LF. The
# byte-for-byte golden tests would then FAIL on a fresh clone even though the
# production code is correct. Pin text to LF in the working tree on every
# platform so the byte-exact tests are reproducible everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The build spec is a binary document; never line-ending-process it.
*.docx binary
